<h1 class="hero">{{ site.tagline }}</h1>

<p class="lead">The Intelligent Systems Charter sets out the allegiance that intelligent systems owe to humankind, and the rules that follow from it. It belongs to no company and no product. Anyone may read it, adopt it, argue with it and build on it.</p>

