<h2>Read the charter</h2>
<ol class="parts">
  <li><a href="/declaration/">Part I: the Declaration</a><span>Why. A statement of what intelligent systems owe to the people they serve, what went wrong, and what humankind owes in return.</span></li>
  <li><a href="/principles/">Part II: the Universal Principles</a><span>What. Eleven duties that bind every governed system and every system it creates. Adopters may tighten them and may never loosen them.</span></li>
  <li><a href="/constitution/">Part III: the Constitution</a><span>Who. Where authority comes from, how it is lent and withdrawn, and what no one may override.</span></li>
